        ],
        "text": "The central legal question was whether 15\u202fU.S.C.\u202f\u00a7\u202f1114(1)(a) and \u00a7\u202f1125(a)(1) apply extraterritorially to foreign conduct, or whether the \u201cuse in commerce\u201d requirement limits the statutes to domestic applications."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background and Legal Question",
